cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this pre-release proof package, cite the software package and the
  canonical unified manuscript. No DOI, public release, or archival version
  has yet been assigned.
title: >-
  Reproducible Ramsey Analysis Across Asymptotic and Finite Regimes:
  Research Software and Proof Certificates
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xin
    given-names: Cheng
abstract: >-
  Reproducible materials for a unified Ramsey manuscript containing a
  source-relative asymptotic diagonal upper bound, a source-relative
  fixed-ratio Gaussian lower-bound addition, and a proof-carrying local finite
  SAT barrier.
keywords:
  - Ramsey numbers
  - computer-assisted proof
  - interval arithmetic
  - Gaussian random graph
  - SAT
  - DRAT
